        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A seed of a bean plant from one of several genera of the flowering plant family (Fabaceae).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Damion Dooley's note.  This could be enhanced to explicitly state the anatomical parts of a seed - seed coat, cotyledons, embryo etc.  Currently the Plant Ontology is not explicit about this yet.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <dcterms:contributor>Damion Dooley</dcterms:contributor>
        <dcterms:contributor>https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5275-8866</dcterms:contributor>
